[0.707935, "o", "\u001b[2mAn agent must 'find the weather in New York & convert to Fahrenheit'.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mIts web_search tool times out... so it retries. And retries. Seven times,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mall identical, all failing — then the run dies with 'Maximum retries exceeded'.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
